{"page_id": "synth_copies-images_sva9e625e6-p1", "markdown": "# Strategic Report\n\nGovemance\n\nFinancial Statements\n\nAUTOCLAVE TECHNOLOGY\n\n• POLYOLEFII\n\nMOTAI\n\nAZOTE®\n\n• Read more page 8\n\nPremium durable foams\n\nThese foam sheets and blocks are manufactured from common polymers using our unique nitrogen expansion process.\n\n- HPP\n\nZOTEK®\n\n• Read more page 8\n\nLightweight technical foams\n\nFoams which offer superior technical properties such as energy management, durability and heat and/or fire resistance. ZOTEK foams are manufactured from engineering polymers using our unique nitroger expansion process.\n\n• HpP\n\nT-FIT®\n\n• Read more poge 0\n\nTechnical insulation for industry\n\nA range of insulation products manufactured from Zotefoams' own ZOTEK block foam materials.\n\nT-FIT insulation products are purpose designed to perform in demanding environments.\n\nEXTRUSION TECHNOLOGY\n\nMEL\n\n• Read more page 9\n\nInnovative and accessible technology for greener, lower-cost plastic products This pioneering technology injects gas into plastics during the manulacturing process to create micro-bubbles and is licensed to customers manufacturing plastic parts. The end-product uses 15-20% less material. Recently developed ReZorce recyclable mono-material barrier packaging solutions use this technology\n\nKey markets served\n\nAutorotive\n\nAviation\n\nBuilding and construction\n\nIndustrial\n\nMarine Medical\n\nMilitary\n\nProduct protection\n\nSports and leisure\n\nKey markets served\n\nAutomotive\n\nAviation\n\nConstruction\n\nProduct protection\n\nKey markets served\n\nFood and personal care manufacturing\n\nHigh-temperature processing environments\n\nPharmaceutical, biotech and semiconductor cleanrooms\n\nKey markets served\n\nAutomotive\n\nConsumer packaging\n\nZotefoams pic\n\nAnnual Report 2022\n\nKey market drivers\n\nLight.\n\nweighting\n\nEnergy\n\nKey market drivers\n\nLightweighting\n\nHightechnology\n\nFire\n\nSolely\n\nKey market driver